does not surface them first\n\nYou can't really call this social media anymore.", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2115983936195297639"}, {"author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:37:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115981377652822479"], "id": "2115981377652822479", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 206, "impression_count": 48931, "like_count": 464, "quote_count": 19, "reply_count": 88, "retweet_count": 34}, "text": "I had Opus build a game that takes JIRA tickets from any of your real projects &amp; converts them into dramatic audiologs that are the plot of a 2000s-era horror game set on a mysteriously abandoned space station.\n\nPlay a demo: https://t.co/RbDIxOky2Y\nGithub: https://t.co/bk3mjOoPbQ https://t.co/HLqPg40mcJ", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2115981377652822479"}, {"author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:22:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115977595724660945"], "id": "2115977595724660945", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 29539, "like_count": 208, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 26}, "text": "Q3 US GDP growth hit 3.4%, the highest in a year.\n(New York Times chart below.)\n#economy #markets #growth https://t.co/NVDUGHWrA0", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2115977595724660945"}, {"author_id": "612896910", "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115949299989373379"], "id": "2115949299989373379", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2537, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Baseball's championship series ran through Milwaukee and Tampa https://t.co/h2rKXmymle #BLSdata https://t.co/skfGM5dPL4", "url": "https://x.com/BLS_gov/status/2115949299989373379"}, {"author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-10-29T20:59:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115911454994186301"], "id": "2115911454994186301", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 204, "impression_count": 33546, "like_count": 467, "quote_count": 23, "reply_count": 147, "retweet_count": 46}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115822019518370172", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This research gets at something missing from most debates about AI’s economic impact: coordination. \n\nOrganizations are more than the sum of their best performers, so smarter individual agents won’t transform the economy on their own. Agents that can coordinate together might do. https://t.co/4Ak3AjeAM5", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2115911454994186301"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "83466368", "name": "European Central Bank", "username": "ecb"}, {"id": "332617373", "name": "Mohamed A. El-Erian", "username": "elerianm"}, {"id": "1214528593", "name": "Miles Brundage", "username": "Miles_Brundage"}, {"id": "39125788", "name": "Ethan Mollick", "username": "emollick"}, {"id": "612896910", "name": "BLS-Labor Statistics", "username": "BLS_gov"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2116062672177267061", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlxod0pujm48fzp9klo1kapx5bwd", "oldest_id": "2115911454994186301", "result_count": 8}}
